Package: datasentinel-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Recommends: libmagic1
Maintainer: DataSentinel <security@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/your-org/datasentinel
Description: DataSentinel endpoint data risk discovery agent
 Read-only, local-first PII and secret discovery scanner for authorized
 enterprise security teams. Discovers files, detects personally
 identifiable information and credentials (API keys, private keys, cloud
 credentials, ...), scores risk, and reports redacted findings to a central
 DataSentinel backend. Never uploads whole files by default and never
 executes anything it finds while scanning.
 .
 Installs a systemd service (datasentinel-agent) that runs scheduled scans;
 see /etc/datasentinel-agent/agent.env to configure backend connectivity,
 and /etc/datasentinel-agent/scan-config.yaml to override scan profiles,
 include/exclude paths, and risk thresholds.
